# Math macros — exhaustive smoke test

This document calls every macro defined in `themes/fau-lme/math.qd` so that a
breaking change in Quarkdown's KaTeX bridge or in our `.texmacro` definitions
fails the build instead of silently producing the wrong glyph.

## Vectors and matrices

Inline: $ \vec{x} $, $ \vec{\alpha} $, $ \mat{A} $, $ \mat{\Sigma} $.

Display:

$$$
\mat{A} \vec{x} = \vec{b}, \qquad \mat{A} \in \real^{m \times n}, \vec{x} \in \real^{n}
$$$

## Linear-algebra ops

Inline: $ \transp{\mat{A}} $, $ \norm{\vec{x}} $, $ \abs{x} $.

Display:

$$$
\norm{\mat{A} \vec{x} - \vec{b}}^{2} = \transp{(\mat{A} \vec{x} - \vec{b})} (\mat{A} \vec{x} - \vec{b})
$$$

## Number sets

Inline: $ \real $, $ \nat $, $ \integers $, $ \complex $, $ \rationals $.

Display:

$$$
\nat \subset \integers \subset \rationals \subset \real \subset \complex
$$$

## Optimization operators

Display:

$$$
\hat{\theta} = \argmax_{\theta \in \integers} \mathcal{L}(\theta), \qquad \hat{\theta}_{\mathrm{MSE}} = \argmin_{\theta \in \real^{n}} \norm{y - f(x; \theta)}^{2}
$$$

## Floor, ceiling, big-O

Inline: $ \floor{x} $, $ \ceil{x} $, $ \bigO{n^{2}} $.

Display:

$$$
\bigO{n \log n} \le \bigO{n^{2}} \le \bigO{2^{n}}, \qquad \floor{x + \tfrac{1}{2}} \approx \ceil{x - \tfrac{1}{2}}
$$$

## Composition stress test

A compound expression that uses many macros at once — if KaTeX swallows one
silently this will look wrong:

$$$
\hat{\vec{x}} = \argmin_{\vec{x} \in \real^{n}} \left[ \norm{\mat{A} \vec{x} - \vec{b}}^{2} + \lambda \abs{\transp{\vec{x}} \mat{A} \vec{x}} \right] \quad \text{with complexity } \bigO{n^{3}}
$$$
